<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 12:38:03 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>新皮质 Tau 负荷的血浆生物标志物</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/plasma-biomarkers-for-neocortical-tau-burden</link><description>本研究试图开发并验证多蛋白血浆组，以提高对新皮质 tau 病理学的识别，而不仅仅是磷酸化 tau-217。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/plasma-biomarkers-for-neocortical-tau-burden.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 12:38:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/plasma-biomarkers-for-neocortical-tau-burden</guid></item><item><title>分子结构为帕金森病靶向治疗提供路线图</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/molecular-structures-provide-roadmap-for-targeted-parkinsons-disease-therapeutics</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 12:23:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/molecular-structures-provide-roadmap-for-targeted-parkinsons-disease-therapeutics</guid></item><item><title>摘要：克伦比尔脑研究所，大学健康网络，多伦多，安大略省，加拿大</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/abstract-krembil-brain-institute-university-health-network-toronto-ontario-canada</link><description>3&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/abstract174.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 12:08:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/abstract-krembil-brain-institute-university-health-network-toronto-ontario-canada</guid></item><item><title>芯片上的简单血液测试可以帮助诊断肺癌</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/simple-blood-test-on-a-chip-could-help-diagnose-lung-cancer</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 11:53:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/simple-blood-test-on-a-chip-could-help-diagnose-lung-cancer</guid></item><item><title>如何记住罕见事件</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/how-rare-events-remember</link><description>一种关于罕见重复事件的新理论消除了最近发生的事件缺乏对先前事件的记忆的简化假设。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/how-rare-events-remember.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 11:38:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/how-rare-events-remember</guid></item><item><title>“飞焦点”激光器克服了等离子体粒子加速器的关键限制</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/flying-focus-laser-overcomes-key-limitation-in-plasma-based-particle-accelerators</link><description>在一个新的&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/flying-focus-laser-overcomes-key-limitation-in-plasma-based-particle-accelerators2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 11:23:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/flying-focus-laser-overcomes-key-limitation-in-plasma-based-particle-accelerators</guid></item><item><title>在预测人们的偏好时，考虑“三者的力量”是值得的</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/when-it-comes-to-predicting-peoples-preferences-it-pays-to-consider-the-power-of-three</link><description>美国心理学家 LL Thurstone 在其 1927 年的论文《比较判断法则》中提出，当人们从多个选项中选择一个选项时，他们会选择对他们来说价值最高的选项，尽管他们无法为该选项指定一个特定的数字。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/when-it-comes-to-predicting-peoples-preferences-it-pays-to-consider-the-power-of-three.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 11:08:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/when-it-comes-to-predicting-peoples-preferences-it-pays-to-consider-the-power-of-three</guid></item><item><title>DNA 修复酶有利于特定序列，塑造人类基因组中的突变模式</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/dna-repair-enzymes-favor-specific-sequences-shaping-mutation-patterns-in-the-human-genome</link><description>当伤口不能正常愈合时，就会留下疤痕。同样，突变（遗传密码的永久性改变）通常是受损 DNA 未得到适当修复的结果。突变会阻碍基因的功能并导致疾病和衰老，但它们也是遗传变异的根源，遗传变异使新性状出现并促进进化过程。科学家们仍然不完全明白为什么一些受损的 DNA 片段能够成功修复，而另一些则不能。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/dna-repair-enzymes-favor-specific-sequences-shaping-mutation-patterns-in-the-human-genome.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 10:53:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/dna-repair-enzymes-favor-specific-sequences-shaping-mutation-patterns-in-the-human-genome</guid></item><item><title>工程酶以高选择性形成碳-碳和碳-氮键</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/engineered-enzymes-forge-carbon-carbon-and-carbon-nitrogen-bonds-with-high-selectivity</link><description>曼彻斯特生物技术研究所的研究人员，包括 Zachary Birch-Price 博士和 Anthony Green 教授，开发了一种新的工程酶家族，可以产生几种不同类型的化学键，用于构建复杂的分子。这项工作展示了人工酶如何能够以高选择性进行广泛的碳-碳（CC）和碳-氮（CN）成键反应，为生物催化提供了新的可能性。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/engineered-enzymes-forge-carbon-carbon-and-carbon-nitrogen-bonds-with-high-selectivity2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 10:38:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/engineered-enzymes-forge-carbon-carbon-and-carbon-nitrogen-bonds-with-high-selectivity</guid></item><item><title>石墨烯驱动的软透镜可以为智能眼镜、相机和医疗设备铺平道路</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/graphene-powered-soft-lens-could-pave-the-way-for-smarter-glasses-cameras-and-medical-devices</link><description>立即改变焦点的能力是大多数人认为理所当然的事情。每天，我们的眼睛都会毫不费力地在读书、认出房间另一边的面孔或观察头顶上飞过的鸟儿之间切换。然而事实证明，复制这种卓越的技术灵活性要困难得多。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/graphene-powered-soft-lens-could-pave-the-way-for-smarter-glasses-cameras-and-medical-devices.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 10:23:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/graphene-powered-soft-lens-could-pave-the-way-for-smarter-glasses-cameras-and-medical-devices</guid></item></channel></rss>